{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"70831e9a71aac762","name":"card_event_sea_embargo","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Britain/CovertOp/events/card_event_sea_embargo","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"SEA EMBARGO","text":"Give target unit +1+1. If its an air unit, Develop a British air unit with 2 or less attack.","flavorText":"During WWII, the Allied naval blockade of Germany from 1939 to 1945 became a major component of the Allied strategy. The blockade was primarily enforced by the British Royal Navy, which used its naval superiority to intercept ships and prevent goods and resources from reaching enemy territories by sea. By disrupting supply lines and depriving Germany, and later Italy, of essential resources such as food, fuel, and raw materials, the blockade significantly hampered the Axis war effort. This economic strangulation led to widespread shortages, rationing, and a decline in living conditions for civilians in Germany. Despite Germany's attempts to evade the blockade through domestic production increases and alternative supply routes, the sustained pressure played a crucial role in undermining Germany's military capabilities and ultimately contributed to the Allied victory in WWII.","faction":"Britain","type":"order","rarity":"Common","cost":2,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"GameplayTags":["ability.develop"],"Name":"card_event_sea_embargo","title":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_event_sea_embargo_title","SourceString":"SEA EMBARGO","LocalizedString":"SEA EMBARGO"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Britain","kredits":2,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_event_sea_embargo_text","SourceString":"Give target unit +1+1. If its an air unit, Develop a British air unit with 2 or less attack.","LocalizedString":"Give target unit +1+1. If its an air unit, Develop a British air unit with 2 or less attack."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":